window.products.push({"id":1096035,"name":"Western Saddle Rope Hat Cowboy Memorabilia Photo Wall Picture B/G Matted 13x16 Framed Art Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712gVHIbQKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This high quality art print is double matted using black over gold matting and comes in a black solid wood frame. A real piece of glass is then added in front to protect the art. The art piece is fully assembled by our own professional framers and comes ready to hang on your wall. The double matting allows this image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any room. Here at Art Prints Inc. we are 100% committed to providing you with the best selection of high quality premium grade art prints framed or unframed. We take great pride not only in the quality of art we offer but also in building long lasting relationships with our customers. We want you to be 100% satisfied with your purchase. Please, feel free to contact us with any question or questions you may have.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712gVHIbQKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art Prints Inc","source_asin":"B00A28DP1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A28DP1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A28DP1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096036,"name":"Vacu Vin Active Cooler Wine Elegant - Reusable Wine Bottle Cooler - Black - Wine Cooler Sleeve For Standard Size Bottles - Insulated Wine Bottle Chill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAlftZ9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Vacu Vin Elegant Wine Cooler - Black The Elegant Wine Cooler is an adaption of Vacu Vin’s original Rapid Ice collection. In addition to the chilling sleeve, the product also features a rigid black outer shell that looks highly attractive on the tabletop. The cooling element contains 6 pockets of specifically-formulated, non-toxic gel that expand when placed in a freezer for a period of 6 hours or more (it will lie flat, so only requires minimal space). Upon removal, the Rapid Ice sleeve is inserted into the rigid outer shell via its removable base. Once the wine bottle is placed within the outer shell - and is in contact with the cooling element - its contents will then be chilled within 5 minutes. The wine will then remain cold for hours thereafter. Multiple polyester foil layers and foam pouches within the chilling sleeve ensure that the temperature is retained.  The award-winning cooling element is both flexible and virtually unbreakable. It is also lightweight and easy to transport for use at parties, picnics, barbecues, on holiday etc (without the outer shell). Once used, simply return the item to the freezer for subsequent re-application to the outer shell. The Elegant Wine Cooler is also available as part of the Vacu Vin Wine Set. About Vacu Vin Vacu Vin was originally established in 1986 in order to manufacture and distribute the iconic Vacuum Wine Saver. Since then the family-owned company has evolved into a leading brand within the housewares industry, offering an array of barware accessories and kitchen gadgets that are characterised by their quality and innovative functionality. In addition to the Vacuum Wine Saver, Vacu Vin’s product portfolio also includes the award-winning Rapid Ice Coolers and Pineapple Slicers, all of which are now used in over 35 million households and more than 80 countries throughout the world. A specialist in-house design team are constantly striving to add new items to the company’s ever-evolving assortment in order to satisfy the demands of the modern-day consumer. Social Involvement and Fundraising Social involvement has always been at the forefront of Vacu Vin’s philosophy. The company employs over 150 mentally and physically disadvantaged people at their head office production facility in order to assist in the assembly and packaging of almost every product. Vacu Vin also funds the ‘Sharing Success Foundation’, which has helped over 50,000 disabled children and contributed significantly to the development of new facilities in numerous countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yAlftZ9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacu Vin","source_asin":"B00005AS55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AS55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AS55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096037,"name":"ArtbyHannah 4 Panels 10x10 Inch Framed Minimalist Line Wall Art Decor with Decorative Abstract Woman's Body Shape Art Prints Picture Frame Collage Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NORe4BfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Original Design】ArtbyHannah is a Chinese brand adhering to original designs. TThis is an artwork from a creative designer of our team who tried to bring minimalism to a modern home. This is why he applied simple line to show female characteristics on light-wood frames and “minimalist line”as the core. 【Value for Money 】As an integrated brand specialized in home decoration, our business accomplishes all the work including research,design,manufacturing and marketing on our own. Therefore, we can maintain low cost and be able to offer customers the best value products. 【Delicate Prints】the attached prints are printed on gelatin paper by giclee printing technology which enables the inserts durable and colour fast. Therefore, you are given the freedom to keep the prints as a deco or replace it with your picture. 【PS Frame】Compared to MDF frame,the advantages of ps frame are more cost effective, waterproof, moisture-proof and lighter. Actual size is 9.5 x 9.5 inches. 【Considerate Packaging 】In order to give the product full protection, solid corner protector, blister wrap and sturdy carton are employed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NORe4BfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtbyHannah","source_asin":"B08LG3X1ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG3X1ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG3X1ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096038,"name":"N'icePackaging 6-Pack 5.75\" Tall - Beige Linen Earring T Stand Display T Shape Showroom and Tradeshow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KuDTahNkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful linen T-Shape Free-Standing Earring Displays by N’icePackaging will proudly display your earrings whether in a showcase, countertop, business, tradeshow, homeshow, or even your bedroom and have a true look and feel of pure quality. Once you get your hands on these little displays, you’ll see that you made the right investment!! They Displays have that perfect balance of style and subtlety. The design is simple, yet striking; the color modest, yet daring,.. how could you go wrong! They work wonderfully to display any of your most prized earrings, but it especially does a handsome job of displaying silver and diamond earrings! They’re ready to go right out of the box, too. No set up is required at all, No Muss, No Fuss! There are two small holes pre-drilled into the T-Bar so all you have to do is slip on your favorite pair and show them off to the world! And, they keep a nice low-profile!.. They’re each free-standing at only 1 ¼” Deep, and each T-Bar spreads out a modest 2 ½” wide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KuDTahNkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N'ice Packaging","source_asin":"B06XNXHT9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XNXHT9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XNXHT9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
