window.products.push({"id":1096054,"name":"Margaritaville DM0500 Bahamas 36-Ounce Frozen-Concoction Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HrhHWoCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Make a perfect pitcher of margaritas or other frozen drinks in one easy step. view larger Capture that casual island attitude. The Only Frozen Drink Maker with Shaved Ice Nothing captures that casual islands attitude quite like a Bahamas Frozen Concoction Maker. Man oh man, does it ever keep the icy cold drinks flowing. Put it on \"Shave 'n Blend,\" and it automatically churns out a full, 36-ounce pitcher of frozen drinks as good as any you'll ever get in a restaurant. If you want to put your own spin on the concoction, use the custom \"shave only\" or \"blend only\" setting. You'll be sipping on a slice of paradise in no time. It's better with the Bahamas Frozen Concoction Maker. Highlights: The only frozen drink maker that shaves ice--instead of crushing/pulverizing The only frozen drink maker that shaves ice--instead of crushing/pulverizing Make a 36-ounce frozen drink in one easy step with the automatic \"Shave 'n Blend\" cycle Make a 36-ounce frozen drink in one easy step with the automatic \"Shave 'n Blend\" cycle Customize the consistency of drinks using the manual \"shave only\" or \"blend only\" setting Customize the consistency of drinks using the manual \"shave only\" or \"blend only\" setting The blending jar really lasts--it's high-quality, dishwasher-safe, and shatter-proof The blending jar really lasts--it's high-quality, dishwasher-safe, and shatter-proof Forget about watery, slushy drinks because melting ice is channeled away Forget about watery, slushy drinks because melting ice is channeled away A Tropical Breeze to Use Designed with markings up the side. After measuring in the ingredients, release into the blending jar, and you're well on your way. For manual control, there's a handy \"blend only/shave only\" toggle switch, which lets you add more ice--and blend it as long as you want. Shatterproof Blending Jar The Bahamas Frozen Concoction Maker provides a durable plastic blending jar with a roomy 36-ounce capacity, measuring marks up the side, and a generous easy-grip handle. Both the No-Brainer mixer and the blending jar/lid are dishwasher-safe for quick cleanup. No-Brainer mixer for mixing top 3 frozen drinks and releasing right into jar. view larger Automatic \"Shave 'n Blend\" cycle--or toggle between manual \"blend only\" or \"shave only\". view larger Shatterproof, 36-ounce plastic blending jar. view larger What's in the Box? Margaritaville DM0600 Bahamas Frozen Concoction Maker, 36-ounce plastic blending jar, No-Brainer mixer, user manual From the Manufacturer The New Margaritaville Frozen Concoction Maker - Bahamas is your passport to transport your next party to the islands. Simply fill the top reservoir with ice, pour your favorite ingredients into the jar and at the touch of a button, the Shave-N-Blend controls automatically make a pitcher-perfect 36 ounces of frozen margarita deliciousness in one easy step. The shaved ice ensures better drink consistency - no more ice chunks or watered down drinks. The Bahamas allows you to shave only and blend only to create customized frozen concoctions by adding more shaved ice or blending a little bit longer. The ice reservoir holds enough ice to make one full pitcher of margaritas in one automatic cycle, while melting ice is channeled into a rear reservoir to avoid watered-down drinks. The tropical color, nautical design elements and chrome accents make the Bahamas the perfect party enhancer for your next spur of the moment party. The blending jar and its components are all dishwasher safe, and the rest of the unit quickly wipes clean. Accessories include a Margaritaville shot glass, a quick start guide, a frozen drink recipe guide, and an instruction manual. The Frozen Concoction Maker - Bahamas is your escape to paradise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HrhHWoCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Margaritaville","source_asin":"B004BAX8DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004BAX8DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004BAX8DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096055,"name":"Mother's Day Gift Birthday Gift Box Flower Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZCUIfAzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♥ Product Specification ♥ Material:Vegetable Wax 85%±5%/Beeswax 15%±5%. Size: Approx. 6.7in. X 2in. X 1.6 in. ♥Package Content ♥ 3 x Handmade Candle. ♥Warn Tip ♥ Please NOT let children or pets touch the candles or lean over them. ♥Sweet Customer Service ♥ Bring forth new ideas can more than accommodate all your party and event needs! Contact us firstly if you have any question, we will reply to you in 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EZCUIfAzS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iLikePar","source_asin":"B08YR17W7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YR17W7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YR17W7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096056,"name":"All About Details Blue Sweet Sixteen Banner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914hPtP8vSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We understand the risk of purchasing item online. AAD is transparent in providing product information/description to help our customers in their purchasing decision. Below is a list of important factors that (we believe) you need to consider in finalizing this order. MATERIALS: AAD cake topper is made up of 3-layer cardstock. Cardstock is a paper stock that is thicker and more durable than normal writing or printing paper. It is thinner and more flexible than other forms of paperboard. Glittered cardstock is the accent cardstock in every AAD cake topper. This glittered cardstock securely holds the glitters as it is laminated which makes it food safe. Due to the quality of this glittered cardstock, we need to use a spray adhesive. The 3-layer cardstock provides thickness to hold the intricate design of the topper. The food-safe wood sticks can be adjusted with scissor depending on your cake’s thickness. PROCESS: Each cardstock is run in die-cut machine for its intricate design. On the 3rd layer cardstock, wood sticks are fastened with glue. The 3rd layer with wood stick are set aside for drying time. Spray adhesive are applied in the other layers of cardstock. All the materials are carefully assembled in reference of the product’s final dimension. Please take note that each topper is uniquely made as it is manually assembled. Another more minutes are required for drying process. Once dried, Quality Personnel carefully checked the item and approved for packaging. PACKAGING: Each topper is packed with chipboard to ensure product’s excellent condition against shipping process. It is packed in a transparent plastic so customers will have a clear look on the item while it’s still sealed. The other side of the packaging is the product’s label with product description and tips on product handling/usage. If you have further questions regarding this product, feel free to send us message and our customer service department will be happy to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914hPtP8vSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All About Details","source_asin":"B01EVOEP9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EVOEP9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EVOEP9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
