window.products.push({"id":1096058,"name":"Classy Art Alma Moulton Barn by Shelley Lake Framed Print Wall Art, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-uCMilV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This barn is all that remains from the Homestead of Thomas Alma Moulton. It lies in the Grand Teton National Park in an area known as Antelope Flats and has become the symbol of Jackson Hole. Feel the great outdoors everyday with this beautifully framed photograph print from Shelley Lake. This beautifully designed piece is elegantly framed using a 3 inch profile made of a scratch resistant MDF in a Cinnamon Mocha color. It is framed under real glass and it is ready to hang with all the hardware pre-attached. Shelley Lake received a Bachelor of Fine Arts degree from the Rhode Island School of Design in 1976. Her experimentation with art and technology began more than 40 years ago, as a computer science major at Brown University. In 1979, Lake earned a Master of Science degree from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology and became the first female graduate of the Architecture Machine Group, the institution now known as the Media Lab. At MIT, she trained with Nicholas Negroponte and Harold Edgerton, pioneers in the fusion of science, art and technology. Featured in numerous international art exhibitions and film festivals, she has won a Clio award, Photoshop Guru award, Japan's NICOGRAPH award, placed first in an AT&T image competition and was a technical director for the Academy Award winning, The Last Starfighter. Lake also holds a Doctor of Chiropractic degree from Cleveland Chiropractic College and currently owns and operates, Sky Lake Studios, a visionary computer graphics facility in Central Florida. We bring this piece to your home or office with over 30 years of decorative framing and art experience behind us; sourced from around the globe and proudly Made in America . 18 in. x 42 in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-uCMilV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classy Art","source_asin":"B01LAQ8TVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LAQ8TVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LAQ8TVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
