window.products.push({"id":1096113,"name":"D3: The Mighty Ducks Poster Movie (27 x 40 Inches - 69cm x 102cm) (1996) (Style B)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YRMmLzMBL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a brand new single sided reproduction print of a D3: The Mighty Ducks poster. The paper size is approximately 27 x 40 Inches - 69cm x 102cm  The condition of this item is brand new - mint condition. No pinholes or tape and has never been hung or displayed.  Paper size may not be exact so we recommend waiting until you receive the poster to purchase a frame. This quality reproduction makes a great gift and is perfect for framing. CAST: Emilio Estevez, Jeffrey Nordling, Joshua Jackson, David Selby, Heidi Kling, Joss Ackland, Elden (Ratliff) Henson, Shaun Weiss, Matt Doherty, Michael Cudlitz, Vincent A. Larusso, Colombe Jacobsen, Aaron Lohr, Christopher Orr; DIRECTED BY: Robert Lieberman; PRODUCER: Jordan Kerner, Jon Avnet, Steven Brill, C. Tad Devlin, Walt Disney Pictures, Buena Vista;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YRMmLzMBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decorative Wall Poster","source_asin":"B00KK6ESJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KK6ESJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KK6ESJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096114,"name":"Good Luck Finding Better Coworkers Than Us Coffee Mug Plus Bonus Balloons Coworker Leaving Gifts - Funny Goodbye Farewell Going Away Gift for Parting ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u4mWobLKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Adios, ciao, au revoir, arrivederci! Bidding farewell or bon vonyage to a coworker leaving for another job? We've got the perfect gift  to convey your sentiments. Inscribed with the funny phrase \"Good Luck Finding Better Coworkers Than Us,\" this novelty coffee cup  will remind your departing coworker of the team he or she once belonged to. Our mug makes a great gift from the whole crew at work! 🖤 BOLD BLACK & WHITE DESIGN - Solid Black Kiln Fired Graphics Resistant to Wear, Fading, Peeling Durable ceramic emblazoned with wear-resistant kiln fired graphics. Words don't peel, fade or diminish after washing. ♨ MICROWAVE, DISHWASHER SAFE - Microwaveable, Easy to Clean - Wash on Top Rack of Dishwasher Your leaving coworker will likely be busy with his/her new job. Give a mug that is both microwave & dishwasher safe! ⭐ ALL PURPOSE 15 oz COFFEE MUG - Can be Used for Sipping Coffee or Storing Desk Supplies At New Job He or she will be able to use it as a coffee mug, tea cup, espresso cup, pen holder or catchall. ENDLESS possibilities! Our dual-sided mugs make thoughtful gifts for colleagues when leaving work. Whether gifting to a coworker who is leaving for a new  job or switching departments, we've got the coworker funny gifts everyone will love. Show appreciation for the time you got to work  together by surprising him or her with a special moving away gift. We've added \"P.S. We'll miss you!\" in a smaller print to show how sad  you all are to see him or her go. Wrapped in cute gift boxes, these gifts for work colleagues are ready to be wrapped, bagged or given as is. The office dynamic will never be the same. Celebrate a departure with some office humor. Click ADD TO CART to order your mug now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u4mWobLKL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GWolffy","source_asin":"B07XDDBRB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XDDBRB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XDDBRB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
