window.products.push({"id":1096143,"name":"JOYHILL Electric Kettle Temperature Control,6 Variable Temperature Tea Kettle, Stainless Steel Interior 12 Hours Keep Warm,1500W Hot Water Boiler with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sDCgvPPiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Design for Prefect Beverage】 The electric kettle is suitable for the whole family, which have been preset the proper temp of various drinks for you to choose. Whether you are brewing milk powder, coffee or all kinds of tea, this hot water electric kettle can provide you with the most suitable temperature, The tea kettle electric make every cup of your drink has the perfect flavor. 1.7 liters of large capacity of this water kettle meets various hot water needs of your whole family. 【Faster and safer】 JOYHILL electric water kettle with 1500W output and STRIX thermostat, is faster and safer than traditional stoves kettle. Our kettle water boiler provides 12 hours' smart insulation, allowing you to drink a cup of warm 140 degrees Fahrenheit every moment. STRIX thermostats meet the world's most stringent safety standards and provide protection against overheating and dry burn for this hot water kettle, with a service life of over 12,000 times. 【Durable】JOYHILL stainless steel electric kettle is double layers designed, durable with strictly selected material, the interior of this kettle is 100% made of 304 stainless steel, avoid the formation of scale and rust, provide the purest water taste by using this stainless steel kettle. The shell of this water heater kettle is made of non-toxic, BPA-Free premium plastic, effectively isolate the temp and avoid burns. 【Aesthetic and Reasonable Design】Buttons of top cover, temp control and display of the electric hot water kettle are all embedded in the same plane, concise and beautiful, operated more at ease. Ergonomic 7-shape handle of this smart kettle provides a comfortable grip experience even filled with 1.7 L water. The \"Separate Memory \" function of this water boiler kettle electric allows you to go on with the previous program without resetting, greatly improving the ease of use. 【Quality Assurance】We are very concerned about your family's health and use experience. JOYHILL temperature control electric kettle has passed multiple quality tests before authorized sale (FDA,ETL). Please feel free to use this electric tea kettle temperature control. If you have any problems with the cordless kettle during use, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to help you to solve problems!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sDCgvPPiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYHILL","source_asin":"B09ZJYM51L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZJYM51L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZJYM51L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
