window.products.push({"id":1096380,"name":"Fuller Brush Pretty & Pink Compact Veggie Brush - Easy Grip Durable Vegetable Scrubber For Washing Fruits & Veggies - Clean Vegetables For Home & Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sS5S8egvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of scrubbing your vegetables clean , only to be confronted with bruised and damaged produce ? Scrubbing vegetables just got a whole lot easier! With the Fuller Brush Pretty & Pink Compact Veggie Brush , you can easily and efficiently scrub away dirt from potatoes, carrots, radish, cucumbers, zucchini, tomatoes and more. Whoever said pretty brushes won’t last, has never used a Fuller . Made with a sturdy plastic block that won’t rust, chip or crack – along with straight, durable bristles and concise tufts that won’t shed – this 3½\" x 2¾\" x 2\" brush is designed to last you a long time and provide years of good use! Unique and exclusive to Fuller Brush, the compact handle easily fits in your hand to provide a firm grip even when you’re handling wet and slippery vegetables. Meanwhile, the durable, polyester bristles are designed in a unique concave-shaped pattern that scrubs all types and shapes of vegetables quickly, easily and thoroughly. At the same time, it also simplifies cleaning rounded fruits and vegetables. Best of all, there are no bruises! For added convenience, it’s easy to keep the brush clean. The tufts are spread out in a way so you can easily rinse away any vegetable skin and dirt, and it’s also dishwasher safe . A handy, helpful tool to quickly and efficiently get your vegetables clean, this brilliant-colored, Fuller Pretty & Pink Compact Veggie Brush is even pretty enough to leave out decoratively on your kitchen counter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sS5S8egvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuller Brush","source_asin":"B07FK67LBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FK67LBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FK67LBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
