window.products.push({"id":1096391,"name":"Premium Cotton Percale Bed Sheets - 100% Pure Cotton Egyptian Sheet Set- Made in Egypt - Extremely Soft Sheeting, Deep Pocket, Refreshingly Cool, Ever","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OEvAE1H9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sweet Home Collection Premium Cotton Percale Bed Sheets - Made in Egypt From the Best Cotton in the World - Premium Quality Cotton Bed Sheets Made in Egypt. Why Choose Us? Sweet Home Collection is one of the original top selling bedding and home textile manufacturers on Amazon. At Sweet Home Collection, we strive to create products using the finest textiles possible at reasonable prices. We find techniques that include better stitching, stronger weaving, and more affordable materials. Quality: The saying quality is better than quantity is absolutely true when it comes to these Eygptian sheets. Our Premium Cotton Percale Bed Sheets - is comparable and according to many reports, feels softer, more durable and maintains its quality after more washes than high thread count sheet sets that aren't woven with the same technique and quality that the Egpytian artisans have mastered over thousands of years. Our cotton has been selected by testing and washing dozens of times to ensure it meets needs of our customers that are searching for good products without overpaying. Our cotton sheet set is a fine display of our commitment to quality and customer feedback. Our goal is to create repeat customers for years to come. We now offer the option to choose a fine quality cotton sheet set without adding in any additional costs for marketing and promotional giveaways. At Sweet Home Collection you are paying purely for the value of a premium product. Our Queen and King sheet set includes 4 Pieces: 2 Pillowcases, 1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheets. Each fitted sheet is designed with an additional elastic strap that runs across the corner in order to esure they stay snug and tight around the mattress. With each wash this cotton will become softer. Enjoy our long lasting comfort and we look forward to seeing your feedback below!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OEvAE1H9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Home Collection","source_asin":"B0897XFW42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897XFW42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897XFW42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
