window.products.push({"id":1096449,"name":"3pc Porcelain Kitchen Canister Set with Bamboo Lids - Grey Marble Containers with Airtight Seal – Sugar, Coffee, Flour or Food Storage Jar - Planter F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQrdVV-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pretty storage kitchen containers are a must, and it doesn’t get any more beautiful or practical than Marbelous ! These porcelain canisters come with airtight natural bamboo lids and are perfect to store cookies, sugar, flour, coffee and tea without worry! They can be used to hold and store almost anything and can even be used as planters! PRODUCT FEATURES High Quality Porcelain Air Tight Bamboo Lids Marble Design on Interior and Exterior 2 Piece Sets (Medium or Large) 3 Piece Sets (Small, Medium & Large) COLORS Sky Blue Desert Brown  Grey DIMENSIONS Small - 6\" Diameter, 3.5\" High, 33oz Capacity Medium - 4.75\" Diameter, 6\" High, 44oz Capacity Large - 4.75\" Diameter, 8\" High, 60oz Capacity MULTIPURPOSE USE Not just for keeping food fresh, this can be used as a crock, planter, office supplies or small tools holder and so much more. BRING ELEGANCE TO YOUR KITCHEN What can be more stylish that a complete set of canisters made of deluxe quality porcelain? An aesthetically pleasing ceramic look that is sure to bring back a sophisticated look to any kitchen decor! Unlike other containers, ours is marble inside and out - not just marble painted. They're perfect for any home! AIRTIGHT SEAL Each one of our canisters comes with an all-natural bamboo lid with a food grade silicone sealing ring guaranteed to keep contents completely preserved. Keeps air and insects out - ideal for conserving food that may spoil quickly. EASY CARE Easily wash these canisters by hand or in a dishwasher for ultimate ease! Remove the bamboo lids before placing in the dishwasher and rinse them with water and soap. As easy as 1, 2, 3! With Marbelous you're getting unmatched quality with superior performance! Enhance your home and kitchen setup today and get the best set of porcelain canisters around!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eQrdVV-AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marbelous","source_asin":"B076M7TBJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076M7TBJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076M7TBJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096450,"name":"Fallkniven K2 Fixed Blade 7.0 in Stain Blade Polymer Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":243.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Tx+th9bDL._AC_.jpg","description":"The santoku designed K2, also called White Whale, is without doubt the best knife for vegetables. Thin cut, fresh vegetables are wholesome, they look neat and taste terrific finely shredded. Only the perfectly designed Santoku will do that! The K2 is a modern, ergonomically designed kitchen knife for the professional chef. The broad blade offers a stiffness and rigidity which make the knife perfect for delicate tasks. Also, the shape of the edge allows it to cut in both directions. The benefit of using a special steel is that the blade can be made thinner, lighter and more rigid and this makes your kitchen work easier and more fun. The laminate VG10 special steel will make the edge last longer and this is of course a particular advantage for professionals. The tang runs through the handle at almost full width, which gives both stability and rigidity for the knife. We have paid extra attention to the shape of the handle – the grip must fill the hand without being clumsy while offering a shape that ensures safety when working with the knife. We achieve this by making the handle of thermorun rubber – the better the grip is, the less fatiguing for your hands. On top of that, the handle is easy to keep clean as it has no grooves or dents. The hygienic aspect is an important detail for those who work with food in restaurants and eateries – not the least for their guests. Please note that this knife is not adapted for cutting frozen food, nor chopping bones, this will inevitably result in a broken or bent edge. For such heavy tasks we advise you to use a saw or a cleaver. And finally, the best working base is a cutting board made of wood – they are also more hygienic than plastic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Tx+th9bDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fallkniven","source_asin":"B00CYLN212","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CYLN212","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CYLN212","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
