window.products.push({"id":1096505,"name":"ACE Improved Design 3 Compartment Reusable Eco-Friendly Food Storage Containers. Ideal For Portion Control And Meal Prep. Bento Lunch Boxes For Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AQTbM9PEL._AC_.jpg","description":"ACE Lunch Box addresses the top 3 problems of food containers in the market: 1) Easily cracked box and lids, 2) Flimsy and warped containers , 3) Lids are difficult to lift open Made from 1) Thicker rice husk material. 2) More sturdy and durable with new rib reinforcement. You know it when you feel it. 3) Lifting tab to facilitate lid opening Reusable, Eco-friendly, Toxins free, BPA free. Light-weight. Good for Kids and Adults Compartmentalized to keep your food separate and organized. Leak resistant in between compartments. Tip: Best with dry food. Microwave safe, Dishwasher Safe, Freezer Safe, Food Grade. Comes With A Tint Of Rice Husk Aroma.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AQTbM9PEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACE","source_asin":"B071Y1ZBN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071Y1ZBN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071Y1ZBN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1096506,"name":"HOME-X Microwaveable Bacon Tray, Microwave 2 Egg Poacher, Bacon Serving Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qZQCcu9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who can resist appetizing bacon? It is the kind of meat you need to have right when you smell its delectable aroma. However, frying bacon on the pan or baking it in the oven can take such a long time. Fortunately, we have just the solution for you. Our high-quality bacon rack allows you to quickly cook your bacon in the microwave. It holds several slices of bacon at once, so you can cook up enough slices for your hungry family. Plus, this bacon tray has 2 slots for eggs made to your liking. In just a few minutes, you’ll have a freshly cooked and tasty eggs, a full breakfast. This cooker is made from a strong, durable material that is conveniently microwaveable. Simply place your uncooked bacon strips on this ridged plate, and up to 2 eggs on the 2 slots, then insert the plate into the microwave. Finally, heat it up for however long you prefer and enjoy! It’s that easy. The ergonomic design of this plate makes cleanup a breeze. Its ridges help catch bacon grease, preventing it from pouring out or dripping onto your microwave. Plus, this plate is dishwasher safe. When you’re finished with it, just toss it into the dishwasher, and you’ll be good to go! You can also use this plate as a serving tray for parties. It comes in a neutral white color that will complement most table settings and kitchen decor. Use it during breakfast, lunch, or dinner. It will go well with a party that features pancakes, waffles, or BLT sandwiches. Add this gadget to your kitchen accessories and supplies today. Or, gift it to a friend! It will make a perfect present for a professional chef, talented cook, bacon lover, or dedicated homemaker. They’ll appreciate your thoughtfulness and gratitude in getting them this novelty gift. Order today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qZQCcu9uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07X5C98YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X5C98YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X5C98YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
