window.products.push({"id":1096753,"name":"SEMECH King Bedspread Quilt, Beige Coverlet King Size Quilt Set, Lightwight Quilted Bedspread King Size Coverlet 3pcs Including 1 Quilt and 2 Shams (1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b4UGsm8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXQUISITE QUILTING BEDSPREAD: Made of high-quality brushed microfiber, SEMECH quilted bedspread king size is warm and breathable for year-round use. Our beige king quilt set is designed with fine straight stitching which allows the filling evenly distributed and no knotting after washing. It's a thoughtful gift for birthdays, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, etc. PREMIUM FABRIC: With the pre-washing process, the fabric of our king quilt coverlet set is softer and more durable. 80 GSM polyester brushed fabric shell with 170 GSM polyester filling provides supreme softness and warmth making the king bedspread quilt the perfect choice for a most restful sleep. No pilling, no fading, and no chemical smell. LIGHTWEIGHT & VERSATILE: The coverlets king size quilt is perfect for people with night sweats. Warm but lightweight, you can enjoy a cozy feel all night long without the hassle of turning over and waking up to heat. Whether you place the king coverlet set on the couch or in bed, it will create a comfortable oasis for you. DECORATE HOME: The solid quilting design creates simple and generous patterns on the king quilt bedding set, adding a touch of style to your space. Understated but unobtrusive elegance shows off your taste in the details. The clean and solid color of the quilt set king size is easy to match with any furniture, and you won't get bored after many years of use. 3 PIECE QUILT SET: The bedspread king size includes one striped quilt (106\" x 92\") and two matching pillow shams (20\" x 36\"). If you want a king size quilt that covers more of the side of the bed, If you want a quilt that covers more of the side of the bed, a low bed, or a larger size is recommended. Machine washable and tumble dry on low heat Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b4UGsm8jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEMECH","source_asin":"B09D7JMNGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D7JMNGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D7JMNGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
