window.products.push({"id":1096763,"name":"35 PCS Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit for Kids Adults, Professional Pumpkin Cutting Supplies Knife Set Stainless Pumpkin Carving Tools Kit with Stencil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DJC9IdIOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨VALUE PUMPKIN CARVING SET: 35 pcs brand new Halloween pumpkin carving kit of 2021 includes 5 carving kit, 6 Etching tools, 12 LED candles and 12 pumpkin face stencils. Master carving kit come with bag & fancy box for storage. Great pack with professional pumpkin cutter knife, party decor and toy stickers will help to create an excellent Halloween experience! 🏆PREMIUM CARVING KNIVES: The Halloween carving tools are the easier and safer way to carve pumpkins. The grip is ergonomically designed, hold comfortably. No small grooves, easy to clean. Pumpkin carving knives are made of strong metal, sturdy and hard to rust. Use the pumpkin carving kit, you’ll be surprised of cutting so many pumpkins with ease at a time. ⚡MULTI-PURPOSE CUTTING SET: Each one in the pumpkin carving tool set plays an amazing role in Halloween. Etching set, can be used to make either pumpkins or tempting food garnish. Stickers, best pumpkin stencils for carving & scary window stickers. LED candles, safety wick of a jack-o-lantern or desktop pets. All you need for Halloween program in this pack! 💡DIY UNIQUE JACK-O'-LANTERN: Pumpkin carving kit help to create realistic facial features on pumpkins, make your artwork come to life, perfect for manual DIY. Also it will cultivate kids' practical ability & passion for creation. This pumpkin cutting supplies will not let you down with its precision. Even make your Jack-O-lantern stand out from the crowd! 🎊WARM & FUN FAMILY ACTIVITIES: Carving party kit are suitable for kids adults. Whether hollowing out, decorating, carving or sculpting pumpkins and other fruits or clay, everything is possible with the pumpkin set. Not only can you join the trendy pumpkin carving masterpieces making process, but also enjoy the pleasant Halloween with family and friends!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DJC9IdIOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"arscniek","source_asin":"B098WTZPHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098WTZPHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098WTZPHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
