window.products.push({"id":1096787,"name":"Axolotl Blanket Gift for Girls Kids Lightweight Throws-Just A Girl Who Loves Axolotls Plush Cute Animals Fish Decor Kids Quilt Kawaii Soft Flannel Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dm1IarPAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【PREMIUM MATERIAL】—Virudhaka fleece blanket utilizes 100% 3D air-fiber premium flannel lightweight material, a upgraded ultra fine fiber, which let air flows more easily to achieve good temperature control and promotes maximum WARMTH and SOFTNESS.You will feel extremely soft,lightweight without feeling bulky, while keeping you as warm as you need to be and conducive to a peaceful and comfortable sleep.Cuddling up in a soothing blanket will give you and your family a heavenly experience. ❤【Functional and Decorative】-Virudhaka soft lightweight blanket is perfect for watching TV, relaxing on the couch, or dressing up as a stylish bedspread. It can stay warm and enjoy family fun time while watching your family's favorite TV shows.Also protect your bed and couch from dirty and stain to keep them new and clean.It is also great for outdoor use! Especially when traveling for camping backpacking and picnic outings, it will provide you uninterrupted warmth throughout the seasons. ❤【HD PRINTING PATTERN】-In order to present a more perfect blanket, we have gone through a lot of tests, without losing the softness and comfort of the blanket, we have chosen the most suitable blanket thickness and used the best environmentally friendly ink quality to achieve the maximum softness and warmth yet clearly display the pattern. Note: this blanket is printed on one side, the side that is not printed is white. ❤【BEST GIFT AND 5 SIZES CHOOSE】: The blanket can not only be a practical product, but also printed with unique patterns or interesting words. It is a good idea for family friends as gifts for birthday, Christmas, Halloween, new year, Valentine's day. It will fully express your love.40x30in is suitable for cover legs/cats/dogs/pet; 50x40in is suitable for kids; 60x50in is suitable for girls, boys and backpacking; 80x60in is suitable for women men;120x90in for whole family to watch TV togeth ❤【EASY CARE & SMILE SERVICE】-NO SHEDDING,NO PILLING, it is highly recommended to machine wash this blanket with cold water on a gentle cycle separately; no shrinkage after washing and drying ensures that it stays new and clean even after used for a long time. 100% confident that our products as well as our service will not let you down.If you have any questions, just contact us.We will try our best to help you with in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dm1IarPAS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Virudhaka","source_asin":"B098PTN4JJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098PTN4JJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098PTN4JJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
