window.products.push({"id":1096792,"name":"ANJ Big Power Lift Recliner Chair Wide Electric Massage Recliners for Elderly Fabric Living Room Overstuffed Reclining Chair for Adults with Heated Vi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MXjGFkY9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8 Point Massage & Lumbar Heating】Our recliner chair is equipped with a wire remote control. It with 8 Point massage has 2 different vibration intensities and 5 adjustment modes. You can have a full body massage to relax the upper back, lower back, thigh and lumbar. It also has a heating function, which can further promote blood circulation during the massage process. 【Power Lift Assistance】The powerful single motor design enables the lift chairs recliners for elderly to be adjusting to any position smoothly (Angles: 45°- 150° ), it can lay back or tilt to stand which can help the elderly stand up easily. The wide armrests and comfortable headrest and backrest fit your body completely. The side pocket design provides a place for placing the remote control and other small objects. 【High Quality Metal Frame】This tall man recliner uses a stronger steel frame than other chairs, each steel frame has undergone strict testing procedures, so it is more durable and stronger. It that can easily support your body and has a long service life. The padding of high-density soft sponge will bring you great comfort, it can perfectly wrap your body and help you relax your muscles. 【Comfortable And Antiskid Upholstery】 Whether you’re reading a book or watching a movie, a comfortable chair can relieve the stress of a busy day. Treated fabric surface will bring a warm and soft tactile impression with a high back, thick cushion and high grade antiskid upholstery, providing a very comfortable sitting feel and enhances safety. 【Easy Assemble & Warranty】Less 15 mins installation, Search” ANJ Lift Chair” on YouTube for assembly guide video, all functions used by only two buttons remote control. Overall size: 35.8\"W x 39.7\"D x 42.9\"H, Seat Height – 19.7\", its max weight capacity is about 300lbs. Tips: The lift chair comes with 3 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver them to your door on different days. 1 Year Warranty for quality issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MXjGFkY9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANJ","source_asin":"B09ZQHXF62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQHXF62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQHXF62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
