window.products.push({"id":1096866,"name":"Kalorik Hot Air Popcorn Maker, Healthy Traditional No Oil required Fast n Easy, Low Calorie Snack.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4197B6ChfyL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Kalorik White healthy hot air popcorn maker is an easy-to-use, healthy alternative to a traditional popcorn maker. It uses hot air to pop kernels without the addition of oil, resulting in a crisp and tasty snack. Use the multi-purpose scoop to pour kernels into the popping chamber, then secure the transparent lid and flip the switch-you'll have 8 to 10 Cups of fresh popcorn in just 3 minutes. You can also use the multi-purpose scoop, which rests on the lid, to melt butter as your kernels pop. After popping, you can also use your favorite seasonings to create an endless variety of flavors. Easy to use, the Kalorik Red healthy hot air popcorn maker is ideal for movie nights, game days, or whenever you are craving a healthy snack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4197B6ChfyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalorik","source_asin":"B01ENXF810","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ENXF810","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ENXF810","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
