window.products.push({"id":1096992,"name":"6 Pairs Chopsticks Reusable Set-By LYSHION (Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uua7NVUUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tips ： 1. Generally recommended 3-6 months toreplace the new chopsticks. 2. Chopsticks can be washed safe in thedishwasher, can be reusable. 3. Don't wash chopsticks with hot water. History: Chopsticks were invented in ancient Chinabefore the Shang dynasty (1766–1122 BCE) and most likely much earlier prior toestablishment of the Xia dynasty sometime around 9000 years ago. The firstchopsticks were probably used for cooking, stirring the fire, serving orseizing bits of food, and not as eating utensils. Chopsticks began to be usedas eating utensils during the Han dynasty. Chopsticks were considered morelacquerware-friendly than other sharp eating utensils. It was not until theMing dynasty that chopsticks came into normal use for both serving and eating.They then acquired the name kuaizi and the present shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Uua7NVUUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYSHION","source_asin":"B07KF3VHSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1096992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KF3VHSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KF3VHSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
